## NOTES

### What User Explicitly Wanted
1. ✅ Timeline with video frames (not working in V1)
2. ✅ Remove edit mode/timeline mode toggle (always edit mode)
3. ✅ Vertical remix history (Original → v1 → v2 → Current)
4. ✅ Text prompt on face (no buried UI)
5. ✅ Planner mode as toggle (keep existing, not timestamps)
6. ✅ Store all videos (due to 1-hour download limit)
7. ✅ Backend setup (GCS recommended)
8. ✅ Access previously created scenes (not homepage import)
9. ✅ Automatic remix analysis (no explicit button)

### What User Did NOT Want
- ❌ Homepage video import (removed from requirements)
- ❌ Complicated edit mode toggle (always in edit mode)
- ❌ Timestamp generation in planner (keep planner as-is)
- ❌ Complex UI (wants clean, simple interface)

### Implementation Philosophy
- **Start from clean slate**: Revert to pre-SceneBuilder commit
- **Backend-first approach**: Set up storage/database before UI
- **Incremental validation**: Test each phase before proceeding
- **Reuse existing patterns**: Don't reinvent what works (openaiService, frame extraction, etc.)
- **User-centric UI**: Prioritize clarity over features

